VERSION 2
RULE baseline.mobile.ios.framework.uikit.ios_userdefaults_secret_storage_marker VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "UserDefaults\\.standard\\.set\\(.*(token|secret|password|apikey)" "im"
WHEN TEXT_MISSING "Keychain" "im"
REPORT "iOS UserDefaults Secret Storage Marker"
SEVERITY INFO
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
